      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "BIG RED FLIPPER (1) is still a maiden after 10 runs but rarely out of the placings, the latest filling a minor again when fourth at Gosford. Yet to score from this box but has never missed the frame in two starts. Has ability and can bounce back. ZIPPING KAREEM (2) found traffic in the run and collided, missing the frame when a 18 length fifth (24.32) at Richmond in a Maiden. With a good start should be able to take advantage of the low draw. Should be in this for a long way. NO EXPRESSION (8) has been settling off the speed lately, finishing fourth (22.90) last time in a Maiden at Maitland. Solid beginner and with a good start should have clear running out wide. Should be in this for a long way. ZIPPING YOLANDA (3) deserves plenty of thought at her first run at this distance.",
